  "description": "A young mother who dies in childbirth terrifies her family when she returns as a ghost. A valiant samurai is forced to do battle with nuke-kubi headless yokai. A student is bewitched by the image of a hauntingly beautiful woman painted on a screen door. The unburied corpse of a vengeful ex-wife still throbs with a desire for revenge on the man who divorced her. The tales on these pages range from the subtly mysterious to the spine chilling!\n\nSource: Tuttle Publishing",
